 "purpose": "Every third-party runtime asset the two pages under web/ load, vendored so the published site makes zero third-party requests. Upgrade by replacing a file and its entry here (bytes and sha256), never by a CDN or Google Fonts tag. verify.py checks each entry byte-for-byte and fails on unlisted files.",
